            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "নাগরদোলা — nāgôrdolā — \"a Ferris wheel; a big wheel at a fair\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "মেলায় শিশুরা নাগরদোলায় চড়ল। melāy shishurā nāgôrdolāy chôṛlô. At the fair the children rode the big wheel."
